    "show_share": true,
    "description": "Effective communication is critical for any organisation. In organisations like AKU which use English in many work-related situations, it has become imperative to be able to communicate effectively through English. Indeed, a high level of English is considered an essential global skill. ELE_net's Business English courses provide you with a great opportunity to develop your English skills for business and work-related purposes.",
